# Geordi Project Rules

Geordi is an open-source accessibility browser extension. Mission: help people with disabilities "see" the web as well as anyone.

## Hard constraints

- Core reading features (read page, read selection, play/pause/stop, system voices) are ALWAYS free
- Core reading must work with zero API keys and zero network calls
- Never gate accessibility behind a paywall
- All UI must be keyboard-navigable and screen-reader friendly

## Free vs paid

| Free | Paid or BYOK (Phase 3+) |
|---|---|
| Read page/selection | Page summarization |
| System voices (Web Speech API) | Plain-English AI navigation |
| Heading/link navigation (Phase 2) | Premium human voices (Phase 4) |

